            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/a7b361003da84c103ea20cdb96a4aaab.poster.avif?t=1791489015\" width=616 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/a7b361003da84c103ea20cdb96a4aaab.webm?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/a7b361003da84c103ea20cdb96a4aaab.mp4?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a Pet Producer Robot sent by the Intergalactic Adoption Agency to an un-industrialized island full of adorable pets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to find these pets, figure out what makes them happy, and set up an adoption pipeline to bring love and companionship to the  lonely galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pet cute alien creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Feed them exotic vegetables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build factories and automate petting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Invite friends to create a massive operation together </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize and personalize pets and habitats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the planet and discover secrets  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/f73b3289517d4cd32390d89274814490.poster.avif?t=1791489015\" width=616 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/f73b3289517d4cd32390d89274814490.webm?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/f73b3289517d4cd32390d89274814490.mp4?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Intergalactic Adoption Agency enforces a strict policy for pet welfare. With a certified joy-detecting space elevator, only creatures that are happy, fed, and comfortable can be adopted to the waiting famlies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm local produce to cook for your pets, or outfit them with hats to give them a little bit of personal attention. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/93ffee65481b00b637c0ea97eaef6979.poster.avif?t=1791489015\" width=616 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/93ffee65481b00b637c0ea97eaef6979.webm?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/93ffee65481b00b637c0ea97eaef6979.mp4?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop-in, drop-out multiplayer means that friends can join you anytime! No server configurations, no special modes. Just invite them from your friends list, or make your game open and let any of them join.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/a7b361003da84c103ea20cdb96a4aaab.poster.avif?t=1791489015\" width=616 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/a7b361003da84c103ea20cdb96a4aaab.webm?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/a7b361003da84c103ea20cdb96a4aaab.mp4?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a Pet Producer Robot sent by the Intergalactic Adoption Agency to an un-industrialized island full of adorable pets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to find these pets, figure out what makes them happy, and set up an adoption pipeline to bring love and companionship to the  lonely galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pet cute alien creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Feed them exotic vegetables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build factories and automate petting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Invite friends to create a massive operation together </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize and personalize pets and habitats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the planet and discover secrets  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/f73b3289517d4cd32390d89274814490.poster.avif?t=1791489015\" width=616 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/f73b3289517d4cd32390d89274814490.webm?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/f73b3289517d4cd32390d89274814490.mp4?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Intergalactic Adoption Agency enforces a strict policy for pet welfare. With a certified joy-detecting space elevator, only creatures that are happy, fed, and comfortable can be adopted to the waiting famlies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm local produce to cook for your pets, or outfit them with hats to give them a little bit of personal attention. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/93ffee65481b00b637c0ea97eaef6979.poster.avif?t=1791489015\" width=616 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/93ffee65481b00b637c0ea97eaef6979.webm?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676510/extras/93ffee65481b00b637c0ea97eaef6979.mp4?t=1791489015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop-in, drop-out multiplayer means that friends can join you anytime! No server configurations, no special modes. Just invite them from your friends list, or make your game open and let any of them join.</p>",
            "short_description": "Industrial Petting is a cozy factory game about building an adoption empire of adorable pets! Play with friends or solo. Build happy pet pipelines, explore and farm an alien island, and fulfill adoption contracts from across the galaxy!",
